{"docstring":"CONSTRAINT-ID: CON-T05\n\nauto/config handles both the server and regular editions, with\n--firmware-chroot decided per edition.\nENFORCEMENT (reconcile.py): editions.server and editions.regular are true.","hash":"86462d3df6da45818dd66cf08748cce33ae00f6d909bd994f51addba05acff73","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Constraint"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.constraints.EditionsSelectable","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"CONSTRAINT-ID: CON-T07\n\nDO-NOT-COMMIT/ is gitignored and nothing under it is tracked.\nENFORCEMENT (reconcile.py): local_docs.ignored is true and\nlocal_docs.tracked equals 0.","hash":"5e6c28c1ea366ae0ccd36de7a10a115c772defc7e8dd5747e6573f0ccd6c96d1","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Constraint"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.constraints.LocalDocsIgnored","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"CONSTRAINT-ID: CON-T02\n\nThe built image package list (out/*.packages) contains no X11, Wayland,\ndisplay manager or desktop environment packages (config/gui-allowlist.txt\nentries excepted).\nENFORCEMENT (reconcile.py): no_gui.violations equals 0.","hash":"b32db38922933e593ab274a136a99d52c0ab026c117034fb5a1c369876bd1a43","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Constraint"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.constraints.NoGuiPackages","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"CONSTRAINT-ID: CON-T06\n\nThe retired window manager name (tuiui) does not appear in tracked files.\nENFORCEMENT (reconcile.py): legacy_name.count equals 0.","hash":"d21dc767f2d335bc4cb04ff7ca878c99360ed041400ac318185ec4e7c8025a45","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Constraint"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.constraints.NoLegacyWmName","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"CONSTRAINT-ID: CON-T03\n\nNo private keys, invite tickets or tokens in tracked files.\nENFORCEMENT (reconcile.py): secrets.count equals 0.","hash":"6dc6475db45efe47057adc64f15c82ca4818b78eaed2333d32d89a2b093b1f8e","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Constraint"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.constraints.NoSecretsInTree","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"CONSTRAINT-ID: CON-T04\n\nEvery shell script under scripts/, auto/ and packaging/ parses (sh -n).\nENFORCEMENT (reconcile.py): scripts.failures equals 0.","hash":"cc060573367911fe57caaf7d21d3cb81699b6864510ca2786170380260699d3c","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Constraint"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.constraints.ScriptsParse","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"CONSTRAINT-ID: CON-T01\n\nThe newest out/tetronos-server-*.iso is at most 300 MB.\nENFORCEMENT (reconcile.py): server_iso.within_budget is true. Passes with\na note when no ISO has been built yet.","hash":"385c1b4c49ec2ab1a3bc22779fdda2eb15fc71fb1b06129220c6a3f72c9a0882","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Constraint"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.constraints.ServerIsoUnderBudget","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"The Server ISO is as small as practical, boots as a CD-ROM (not only\nUSB hybrid), has serial and VGA console entries, installs unattended, and\nthe installer TUI works keyboard-only at 16 colors on a serial console.","hash":"abd23b98866c4e162814a943481bacb90e48d36ec41cb698466d618181fec9ac","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.BmcFriendlyServer","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Install mode asks only disk, confirm, username, password and hostname,\neverything else fixed. Expert mode exposes partitioning, LUKS, LVM,\nfilesystem, locale, keyboard, timezone, mirrors and extra packages.","hash":"3b5de5a16c04544ea478fdf817223d72e37b01abaacca51fdcea352c39049499","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.InstallModes","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"tetron-install never touches a disk before an explicit confirm screen\nshowing disk, size, model and the planned layout, refuses the live\nmedium as a target, logs every step, and unwinds mounts and mappings on\nabort.","hash":"efbdb311891a2b5c4f32f8f7dce30d656b98cab5e4774e4292fd165b16c18c5e","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.InstallerSafety","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"No GUI components anywhere, in any edition, on the live medium or the\ninstalled system: no X11, no Wayland, no display manager, no desktop\nenvironment, no GUI installer. Terminal only (kmscon plus tetron-wm).\nUnavoidable library-level dependencies are tracked in\nconfig/gui-allowlist.txt. The build and the VM tests enforce this.","hash":"fd14bb3b349b2b7dd92329f8163a5f081d24afd423d60742283bfa0f04bdadad","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.NoGui","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"No secrets, invite keys, ssh keys or tetron identity are baked into the\nISO, a package, or the repo. Invites are delivered at runtime.","hash":"c1ad08a119e844b88916fd9405a3c62882a178df207818ef82bd264e25453658","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.NoSecretsInImage","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"One source tree, one installer, one test harness for all editions.\nEditions differ only in package lists, firmware lists, boot entries, size\nbudget and metapackage choice (EDITION). No edition-specific code paths in\ntetron-install.","hash":"09447092acb9c15c5bb863e5fe5defa39cc766d166f121278b5b0a06e4ad246b","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.OneTree","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Server work must never block the Regular (fully provisioned) edition.\nPackage lists are split by edition, tetronos-suite is a real metapackage\nfrom the start, kernel and firmware pruning is Server-only, both console\npaths (VGA kmscon and serial) work in both editions, the installer\nsupports offline and network package sources, size budget and firmware\nset are configuration, not code.","hash":"bd8d61a878d7618d98aa930cd6f9b8ea3556ba313e0d507bea46b21361859c0f","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.RegularNotBlocked","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"A fresh clone builds the ISO with make iso. Inputs are pinned (package\nversions, release tags and checksums). The build runs in a Debian 13\nenvironment (VM by default, container optional) and is runner-agnostic.","hash":"9f213df669a3b3c2608233cfdc33e6396fca15d45fcfbed981bf433d6eb546ea","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.ReproducibleBuild","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"The Server ISO is under 300 MB. If a milestone cannot meet it, the\nmeasured size and the top packages are recorded in SIZES.md with next\nsteps.","hash":"c6bf6a4b68b9296cd94430feffbb145e295c72db020375be62cdbce46803afe9","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.ServerSizeBudget","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"All non-Debian software (tetron suite, tetron-wm, fonts, later\ncarbonyl and fresh) enters the image as .deb packages built by\npackaging/ from pinned, checksum-verified inputs. No curl-from-GitHub in\nhooks.","hash":"fbff1821dc026c98613d5667eceebea4c84d7e31c52835e847ac1ad9c140be49","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.SoftwareViaDebs","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Every installed system has its own tetron node identity, ssh host keys\nand machine-id, generated at first boot. Two installs from the same ISO\nnever share them.","hash":"16178934b1e0a568515d2476c6d41c21ec10ea6ecbbcdf748d8fc85b2f3e5070","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.UniqueIdentityPerInstall","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Everything is validated in QEMU/KVM VMs before any real hardware. Real\nhardware validation (pizzabox via BMC virtual media) starts only after\nthe VM acceptance suite passes.","hash":"fddd88b4beb20691a1b4d95872bb8d1630c94735c1504f49f09dde3f7a34877e","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.guardrails.VmFirstHardwareAfter","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone M0 acceptance: make iso EDITION=server completes on a clean\nDebian 13 host (build VM).","hash":"980473db098adb96d3ac331b1f01c41280282f090d7ffddbae42f6396fd8f21b","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.M0RepoAndBuildHost","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone M1 acceptance: Every tetron suite component and addon has a\n.deb that installs cleanly in a debian:trixie container; metapackages\ntetronos-core, tetronos-suite and tetronos-live-config exist.","hash":"03d66cd99e4b84614546c90e33aac45bb56efc5af7ba9027eb54b3df3a5a1b51","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.M1Packages","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone M2 acceptance: ISO boots in QEMU BIOS and UEFI to tetron-wm on\nVGA and to a shell on serial; no-GUI check passes; first size recorded.","hash":"020bbc126789d20e04d3526dbea156759c5b4fa46a46cd79a6eabecbf4763dbc","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.M2BareLiveIso","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone M3 acceptance: Server ISO is within the 300 MB budget or the\ngap is documented with the top 30 packages by size.","hash":"f74babcb5b0a5c34f3e147a30082a97bf69c9622666a37cadcb1004d38efc9a3","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.M3SizePass","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone M4 acceptance: make test-live boots the ISO in BIOS and UEFI\nVMs and passes live assertions over ssh; the harness takes EDITION.","hash":"e9789ff28c3e86d02e4c0c6397bf963328b17c88a98a558dbddf05ab10dfd0d4","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.M4VmHarness","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone M5 acceptance: make test-install performs an unattended\ninstall to an empty virtual disk (BIOS and UEFI), reboots from disk and\npasses ssh assertions; the live medium is refused as a target.","hash":"75fc7373fee3632e08ce11738ca7b145d4ebd800aed4ded1d13864a41fd9a2d7","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.M5InstallerCore","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone M6 acceptance: Two installs from one ISO have different tetron\nnode IDs, ssh host keys and machine-ids; the tetron daemon starts;\ntetron join works against a test network.","hash":"9fc7dff68b09db948f2157978400ef87b1349403906c1ec24b960d73ed4b8e68","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.M6FirstBootIdentity","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone M7 acceptance: The ratatui Install mode completes an install\nby hand on VGA and on serial in both firmware modes.","hash":"d53b5bd3d5b6e65886c91032c93b0b7dbc10398b8672aea2b9c44f2c9a3a9873","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.M7InstallTui","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone M8 acceptance: A fresh clone builds the ISO in CI and the VM\nacceptance suite passes; tag v1.0.0-rc1; checksums and signature\npublished.","hash":"df4e5beb04e13d4820f7f27ac89136054bc52672ab8f7e83ff7a30d091b3f295","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.M8ReleaseCandidate","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone M9 acceptance: The same ISO installs on pizzabox through BMC\nvirtual media; consoles via BMC KVM, Serial-over-LAN and tetron work;\nthe installed system has a unique identity, joins the mesh and powers\noff via BMC; findings in HARDWARE_pizzabox.md; tag v1.0.0.","hash":"2f8178279d7b1a9c5c5eb92698986fbedd92b65387c35b9e3e6618bf8c403a97","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.M9PizzaboxHardware","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone P0 acceptance: packaging/ manifest and build.sh produce a\ntetron-tui .deb that installs and runs in a trixie container.","hash":"825ab274a55adc28fd70af5fe01b36fe862d996bda1fb983102fe68e4d8852ab","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.P0PackagingSkeleton","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Milestone P1 acceptance: debs for tetron, tetron-wm, tetron-webui,\ntetron-messageboard and tetron-sync-receiver install, --version works,\nand unit files pass systemd-analyze verify.","hash":"8bdd3224202df17018ad45ebce17f918c5aa9807cfd34ce43efed25c8255319d","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.P1ReleaseBinaryDebs","type":"component"}
