{"docstring":"Milestone P4 acceptance: make iso builds the debs and installs tetronos-\ncore and tetronos-live-config into the ISO; dpkg -l in the chroot lists\nthem.","hash":"8a9d4ebab832c5e4e843024649b420a0b924ceb43ae5e2f2bf38573b48e53b57","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.milestones.P4IsoIntegration","type":"component"}
