{"docstring":"The tetron core daemon and CLI are packaged as a .deb named tetron,\nbuilt by packaging/ from the pinned upstream release asset (static musl\nx86_64), checksum verified before packaging. Installs /usr/bin/tetron.\nThe package version equals the upstream version with a Debian revision\n(for example 0.14.3-1).","hash":"51696ffa79dc01496d58ad08b0bf565d98569c3476529d54bbfa235e367f2736","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.TetronDeb","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"The tetron deb postinst creates the tetron system group idempotently\n(addgroup --system tetron), so /etc/tetron is created root:tetron by the\ndaemon. The package depends on iproute2, which the daemon calls (ip) to\nconfigure the TUN link.","hash":"b9e6f97605c34ee98935190f21797794f7c9e2a670acb75d79cb46fc2affa48d","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.TetronDebGroup","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"No maintainer script and no build step starts the tetron daemon or\ncreates /etc/tetron/secret_key. The tetron identity is created on first\ndaemon start on the target machine. Purge keeps /etc/tetron so an\nidentity is never deleted by a package operation.","hash":"531aea302e72743f7c839fa7705f15c4c7b86f0c5b00590b3397644e8f47b984","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.TetronDebNoIdentity","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"packaging/tests installs the tetron deb in a clean debian:trixie\ncontainer, checks the file list, and verifies that tetron --version\nreports the package version. The unit passes systemd-analyze verify.","hash":"6a5ee445a998e18d88cda82a1ed45b5b17294d74bcae883611378dc0d0cd17cd","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.TetronDebSmokeTest","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"The tetron deb ships its own /usr/lib/systemd/system/tetron.service\nwith ExecStart=/usr/bin/tetron daemon and no install-time placeholders.\nThe package does not enable or start the service. The ISO build hook\nenables it.","hash":"0d87c57bb289838eb20982ca9ebe3feacdfc11c525375bc1f8443967419f4deb","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.TetronDebUnit","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"On first boot, after the tetron daemon is running, the primary user\n(uid 1000) is made the tetron operator (tetron set-operator USER) so the\nuser can run tetron without sudo. Done by a oneshot unit in tetronos-core\nthat disables itself afterwards.","hash":"0607bb7f00aa6879f6b4f9f478654173c7f03923c98e556e50420edc1f647ed2","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.TetronFirstBootOperator","type":"component"}
