{"docstring":"CONSTRAINT-ID: CON-T08\n\nEvery package in packaging/manifest.toml has a version, a release source\nURL and a sha256 (inline or by URL).\nENFORCEMENT (reconcile.py): manifest.unpinned equals 0 and manifest.parsed\nis true.","hash":"5a56a9585be3d66143ac40fa508ccc53096902892cc201bf7d29cb40b317ebbd","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Constraint"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.constraints.ManifestPinned","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"packaging/manifest.toml is the single source of truth for every\npackage: name, version, Debian revision, architecture, description,\nlicense, homepage, depends, source (release asset URL plus sha256 or a\nsha256 URL), installed files with modes, and maintainer scripts. Nothing\nis built from an unpinned or unverified input.","hash":"8b581100d7655490ca473d1cfbff95ae320520a5fc1dc6782ad6dcf8656316ac","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.PackagingManifest","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"packaging/build.py runs on any host with python3 and dpkg-deb (the\nUbuntu dev host, the Debian 13 build VM, or CI) and writes debs to\npackaging/out/. It is not tied to the live-build environment.","hash":"612cc280904019d0e1d1f126d6646fc67d0513fd745ef8e21376208bfb055d6f","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.PackagingRunsAnywhere","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"packaging/tests/test-debs.sh installs each built deb in a fresh\ndebian:trixie container using apt (so Depends resolve), checks the file\nlist and modes, runs the smoke command, verifies unit files with\nsystemd-analyze, then removes and purges the package cleanly.","hash":"3ba4c9d92ef032d2151704fc8e1c992bb4ef648330c7d283c8598c68a874af65","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.PackagingTestsInCleanTrixie","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"Packages are assembled with dpkg-deb --build --root-owner-group (no\nextra tooling such as fpm), so the build needs only python3 (stdlib) and\ndpkg. Files are owned by root, mtimes are clamped to SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH,\nand the same inputs produce the same package.","hash":"c48c802dbeeeb56e30c51fe1d896b026773d91ae9c73ce1755982e9abcece73b","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.PackagingUsesDpkgDeb","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"The build downloads each release asset into packaging/cache/, verifies\nits sha256 against the published checksum, and aborts with a clear error\non mismatch. A cached file is re-verified before use.","hash":"ca84f2554d15e70de6e3d1fdf213eeb54e04b2fbfe8c8ca03d36683a0fbe6efc","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.PackagingVerifiesChecksum","type":"component"}
{"docstring":"The tetron deb postinst creates the tetron system group idempotently\n(groupadd --system tetron, from the essential passwd package; addgroup is not guaranteed on minimal images), so /etc/tetron is created root:tetron by the\ndaemon. The package depends on iproute2, which the daemon calls (ip) to\nconfigure the TUN link.","hash":"0fa6d8ff9b237a2a4f278d8c9ef8290db7f82f8f09ad4fcdabbb08f76ed200ac","inherits":["libspec.spec_types.Requirement"],"is_template":false,"ref":"spec.packaging.TetronDebGroup","type":"component"}
